
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// PRiSM Round-8 (gap closure) — auto-injected from prism-build/
//   • 33-pta-core          (Well & Test store, analysis data, physical model, lastFit, persistence)
//   • 34-semilog-skin      (MDH / Horner / superposition semilog + skin)
//   • 35-rta-dca           (decline results + rate-transient analysis)
//   • 36-report            (Tab 7 report + CSV export)
//   • 37-prism-workflow    (workflow shell content: flow periods, rail, tools)
//   • 39-prism-fieldtools  (gauge register, sequence of events, ct builder)
//   • 51-prism-workspace   (fit library + compare overlays, analysis branches, model browser)
//   • 52-prism-gas         (gas m(p) results, pseudo-time, skin vs rate, AOF / IPR)
//   • 53-prism-autointerp  (automatic build-up interpretation engine, canon / hash16)
//   • 54-prism-skin        (skin decomposition, PI and skin products, Skin-check card)
//   • 55-prism-autointerp-cal (generated confidence-label calibration table)
//   • 56-prism-dfit-core   (DFIT pre-closure core: events, G family, ISIP, closure, efficiency, geometry)
//   • 57-prism-dfit-aca    (DFIT after-closure, pure pipeline, uncertainty, report model, hand-offs)
//   • 58-prism-dfit-leakoff (DFIT leak-off mini-model, history match, designer, leak budget)
//   • 59-prism-dfit-ui     (DFIT mode extension, step views, panels, plots, report sections)
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
